# Paths the full build owns and Core does not.
#
# Read by spedatox/speda-mark6's sync-to-core workflow. Every commit carried from
# the full build has these paths stripped out of it before it is committed here,
# so a change that only touches them lands as an empty carry and is skipped.
#
# It lives HERE, not in the full build, because Core owns the definition of what
# Core excludes. The fork decided what to delete; this file is that decision
# written down where the next person to widen or narrow it will look.
#
# Format: one gitignore-style pathspec per line. Blank lines and # comments are
# ignored. Directories may be given with or without a trailing slash.
#
# Adding to this list is how you keep something out of Core forever. If you find
# yourself deleting the same file from every sync PR by hand, it belongs here.

# ── Clients Core does not ship ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Core's desktop client is packages/striker. Heartbreaker (the roster build) and
# Speda GO (Android) have no counterpart here.
